# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key.
# .env.local is gitignored and will never be committed to the repo.
#
# Your API key is stored only in your browser (IndexedDB).
# It never touches any server except the Gemini API directly.
# See README for details on the privacy model.
#
# Get a free Gemini API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
